content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le12ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=strong>Denise:</span> Hi Kristi. I see you've received your advanced copy of the manuscript already. Have you had a chance to look at it? <br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> I have, and I'll be honest, I am not pleased with the revisions. At first glance it looked okay, but upon closer inspection, I have found that many of the suggested edits were ignored.<br/>\n<span class=strong>Denise:</span> I know what you mean. I have been looking over it since this morning, and I am a little bit preoccupied with the results. What other concerns did you have?<br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Well, it was mentioned that a few of the more complicated words should be removed, but not one of them was omitted. Then, some very obvious mistakes which should have been taken out were left in. These errors were pointed out by our proofreaders ages ago. Finally, It was claimed that not enough feedback was received. I took copious notes. The margins were jammed with revisions and suggestions. I polished it over and over again. How much more feedback does Marisa need?", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le12ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "56000", "text": "<span class=strong>Denise:</span> She must have made some corrections. Has she really ignored absolutely all of our comments?\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Well, not exactly. She has adjusted all of the visual stuff, like the illustration and caption issues that were pointed out last month. But she hasn't lifted a finger when it comes to the grammatical revisions. These changes were requested on multiple occasions, and they were completely ignored.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le12ob01re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "81000", "text": "<span class=strong>Denise:</span> I have already contacted Marisa about this. When she gets back to me, I'll make it clear that we would like her to compose a new draft, one in which all of our edits are accurately reflected.\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> I'd appreciate that. I made all of my edits with the author's best wishes in mind. I just worry that we may have moved away from her original concept in some places.<br/><span class=strong>Denise:</span> I understand your concern, and I really do appreciate your attention to detail. I'll have the new draft sent to you as soon as possible.\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Thanks Denise, I look forward to seeing it.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le12ob01re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le12ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le12ob01re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}